---
const stats = [
  { number: '3+', label: '年经验' },
  { number: '50+', label: '完成项目' },
  { number: '20+', label: '客户满意' },
  { number: '100%', label: '热情投入' },
];
---

<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-content">
        <span class="section-tag">关于我</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">
          创造优雅的<br />
          <span class="gradient-text">数字体验</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="about-text">
          我是一名热衷于技术与设计的创作者。多年来，我一直致力于将创意转化为现实，
          通过代码构建美观且功能强大的应用程序。
        </p>
        <p class="about-text">
          我相信好的设计不仅要看起来美观，更要为用户提供流畅、直观的体验。
          每个项目都是一次新的挑战，也是一次学习和成长的机会。
        </p>
        <div class="about-actions">
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">开始合作</a>
          <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary">下载简历</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="about-image-wrapper">
        <div class="about-image">
          <div class="image-placeholder">
            <svg width="80" height="80" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
              <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="image-glow"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="stats-grid">
      {stats.map(stat => (
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-number gradient-text">{stat.number}</span>
          <span class="stat-label">{stat.label}</span>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
  }
  
  .section-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-tertiary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .section-title {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }
  
  .about-text {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  
  .about-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .about-image-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  
  .about-image {
    position: relative;
  }
  
  .image-placeholder {
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 2px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  
  .image-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -20px;
    background: var(--accent-gradient);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    opacity: 0.2;
    filter: blur(40px);
    z-index: 0;
  }
  
  .stats-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .stat-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }
  
  .stat-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent-primary);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }
  
  .stat-number {
    display: block;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .stat-label {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 968px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
    
    .about-image-wrapper {
      order: -1;
    }
    
    .image-placeholder {
      width: 200px;
      height: 200px;
    }
    
    .stats-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .stats-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    
    .about-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
